25
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:34,367
And if something changes, I tell the same buyer: ‘The bread needs to go to our other

26
00:02:34,367 --> 00:02:40,000
location.’ It already has the order and the bakery conversation to work from.

27
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:46,000
I handled those emergency supplies and got back to our customers. Meanwhile, the buyer

28
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:52,000
